    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Berkeley & Associates are delighted to present No. 48 Rossmore Road to the market.\r\nThis well-presented, two-bedroom family home offers an excellent opportunity for the discerning purchaser seeking a mature and established residential location within the D10 postcode.\r\nThe living accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, living room, kitchen, bathroom and two well-proportioned bedrooms providing comfortable accommodation.\r\nThe property is presented in turnkey condition throughout, offering prospective purchasers the opportunity to move in with minimal further expenditure. To the rear is a particularly attractive south-facing garden, providing a wonderful outdoor space and excellent natural light throughout the day.\r\nIdeally located just off Drumfinn Road, Rossmore Road is a well-established residential location that benefits from a wide array of nearby amenities, including schools, shops, cafés and sport and leisure facilities. Liffey Valley Shopping Centre is less than 10 minutes away by car, while Moriarty's SuperValu is approximately a 2km walk away.\r\nApproximately 8km from Dublin city centre, the property is well serviced by excellent transport links, with a variety of bus routes available within walking distance. St. Louise De Marillac National School is also located on Drumfinn Road, along with several other schools in the surrounding area.\r\nOverall, No. 48 Rossmore Road represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-maintained, turnkey two-bedroom home in a mature and convenient residential setting. Viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hallway\r\nLaminate wood flooring &pendant lighting \r\n\r\nLiving room \r\nLaminate wood flooring  & pendant lighting , \r\n\r\nKitchen \r\nLaminate wood flooring , range of floor and eye level fitted presses & pendant lighting .  \r\n\r\nBathroom \r\nWC , WHB,  shower , heated towel rail & under sink storage .\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 \r\nLaminate wood flooring , pendant lighting & built in wardrobes .\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 \r\nLaminate wood flooring , pendant lighting & built in wardrobes ."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "• South Facing Rear Garden with two sheds and polytunnel\r\n• Not overlooked to rear\r\n• Sought after location \r\n• Turnkey condition \r\n•Off street parking\r\n•BER: B3 (112452412)"
      },
